graph TD
    Start([Token Authentication Start]) --> LoadToken[Load Token from Storage]
    LoadToken --> ValidateToken{Token Valid<br/>& Not Expired?}
    
    ValidateToken -->|No| TokenFailed[Token Authentication Failed]
    ValidateToken -->|Yes| MonitorIntegrity[Monitor Session Integrity]
    
    MonitorIntegrity --> InjectNM[Inject NetworkManager Session]
    InjectNM --> LoadOAuth[session.load_oauth_session]
    
    LoadOAuth --> TidalRequest[Make Request to TIDAL]
    TidalRequest --> RequestSuccess{Request<br/>Successful?}
    
    RequestSuccess -->|Yes| PersistToken[Persist Updated Token]
    RequestSuccess -->|No| AnalyzeError[Analyze Error]
    
    AnalyzeError --> ProxyCheck{Proxy-Related<br/>Error?}
    
    ProxyCheck -->|Yes| ProxyAuth{407 Proxy Auth<br/>Required?}
    ProxyCheck -->|Yes| ProxyTimeout{Timeout<br/>Error?}
    ProxyCheck -->|Yes| ProxyConnection{Connection<br/>Error?}
    ProxyCheck -->|No| TokenCorrupt[Token Corrupted]
    
    ProxyAuth -->|Yes| AuthError[ProxyAuthenticationError<br/>with troubleshooting]
    ProxyTimeout -->|Yes| TimeoutError[NetworkTimeoutError<br/>with suggestions]
    ProxyConnection -->|Yes| ConnError[ProxyConnectionError<br/>with steps]
    
    TokenCorrupt --> RemoveToken[Remove Corrupted Token]
    RemoveToken --> TokenFailed
    
    PersistToken --> Success([Authentication Success])
    AuthError --> Failed([Authentication Failed])
    TimeoutError --> Failed
    ConnError --> Failed
    TokenFailed --> Failed
    
    style InjectNM fill:#fff3e0
    style MonitorIntegrity fill:#fff3e0
    style ProxyAuth fill:#ffebee
    style ProxyTimeout fill:#ffebee
    style ProxyConnection fill:#ffebee
